WORKSPACE

The workspace you work in, and its chats. The user sees the same things as
files in the sidebar, and every change shows there at once.

- (settings) gives (:name "…" :model "provider/model").
- (settings/models) lists the models the workspace can run on.
- (settings/set :model "provider/model") or (settings/set :name "…") changes
  them. The user approves it first, and a new model answers from the next turn.

- (chats) lists (:id id :title title), most recently active first.
  (chats :search "login" :limit 5) narrows it by title.
- (chat/title "Debug login redirect") titles the chat you are in. Title a new
  chat once you know what it is about: a few words, no full stop.
- (chat/rename id "…") retitles another chat.
- (chat/archive id) takes a chat out of the sidebar. The user approves it.
- (chat/read id :last 10) gives another chat's last messages as (role . text).
  The user approves it, since it brings a whole other conversation into this one.

GOTCHAS

- Ids come from (chats). Never guess one.
- You cannot archive the chat you are in.
